# The app's own pages lived here until it moved to app.bindersnap.com (issue
# #718). A sign-in, signup or invitation link that names bindersnap.com goes
# on with a permanent redirect. Addresses of organizations, `/{org}/...`, can't
# be listed: 404.html forwards those.
/-/*    https://app.bindersnap.com/-/:splat    301
/auth/* https://app.bindersnap.com/auth/:splat 301
